n 2021, making it the third-largest metropolitan area in Canada after Toronto and Montreal. The region, together with the Fraser Valley, makes up the Lower Mainland, which has a total population of over 3 million. Vancouver has the highest population density in Canada, with over 5,700 inhabitants per square kilometre (15,000/sq mi), and the fourth highest in North America.","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Skyline_of_Vancouver%2C_Canada.jpg/330px-Skyline_of_Vancouver%2C_Canada.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vancouver"},"twins":["Q38283","Q1874","Q23436","Q16572","Q65","Q8678","Q9899","Q51103","Q159273","Q612"]}